{"id":"n61126-1-7","stage":5,"title":"사각지대 · 死角地带","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61126-1-7-1","ko":"집에 벌레가 이렇게 많은지 몰랐어.","zh":"我之前都不知道家里有这么多虫子呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"벌레가","meaning":"虫子","explanation":"벌레：虫子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벌레","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59098","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌레가","audio":"/audio/efdac885a1a663284ccb.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"많은지","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은지","audio":"/audio/94b0837e4e3dd7427dbb.mp3"}},{"text":"몰랐어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰랐어","audio":"/audio/b46cbb5cb7db55cf60a5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"ee023753239e5ca1","term":"벌레","zh":"虫子","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3","entryId":"59098","definition":"昆虫或寄生虫等身体结构简单的动物。","pronunciation":["벌레"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3d4fc52b37911fe3e75.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61126-1-7-2","ko":"벌레들이 사각지대에 알을 낳아서 그럴 거야.","zh":"应该是虫子们在那些难以触及的地方产卵了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌레들이","meaning":"虫子","explanation":"벌레：虫子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벌레","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59098","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌레들이","audio":"/audio/859a10549634ebe03906.mp3"}},{"text":"사각지대에","meaning":"死角地带，死角区域","explanation":"사각지대：死角地带，死角区域；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사각지대","audio":"/audio/671e987b28caff6ebc29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61126","senseId":"1","lemma":"사각지대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사각지대에","audio":"/audio/ecfa4535767fa1a73582.mp3"}},{"text":"알을","meaning":"蛋，卵","explanation":"알：蛋，卵；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"알","audio":"/audio/63251c05b0dbf37fa9f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74893","senseId":"1","lemma":"알","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알을","audio":"/audio/a10a7b5b474ae0af25b9.mp3"}},{"text":"낳아서","meaning":"生","explanation":"낳다：生；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"낳다","audio":"/audio/2f8905ecc8e062b159a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64391","senseId":"1","lemma":"낳다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낳아서","audio":"/audio/c1379b41677ab7861e34.mp3"}},{"text":"그럴","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럴","audio":"/audio/96ad41e9f36f46d9e15d.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ee023753239e5ca1","term":"벌레","zh":"虫子","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3","entryId":"59098","definition":"昆虫或寄生虫等身体结构简单的动物。","pronunciation":["벌레"]},{"id":"671e987b28caff6e","term":"사각지대","zh":"死角地带，死角区域","audio":"/audio/671e987b28caff6ebc29.mp3","entryId":"61126","definition":"事物处于该位置时无法被看到的区域。","pronunciation":["사ː각찌대"]},{"id":"63251c05b0dbf37f","term":"알","zh":"蛋，卵","audio":"/audio/63251c05b0dbf37fa9f0.mp3","entryId":"74893","definition":"由雌性鸟、鱼、昆虫等排出，经过一定时间孵化成幼崽或幼虫的球状物。","pronunciation":["알"]},{"id":"2f8905ecc8e062b1","term":"낳다","zh":"生","audio":"/audio/2f8905ecc8e062b159a5.mp3","entryId":"64391","definition":"把肚子里的孩子、崽子、卵送出体外。","pronunciation":["나ː타"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/af4c244198758ece150b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"diffic